Isa 43:1 , The Lord comforts the church with his promises;
Isa 43:8 , He appeals to the people for witness of his omnipotency;
Isa 43:14 , He foretells them the destruction of Babylon
Isa 43:18 . and his wonderful deliverance of his people;
Isa 43:22 , He reproves the people as inexcusable.
